                    {
                        "sense_id": "54f8ad04-27ff-3bad-b13b-6e9ac80391ea",
                        "entry_id": "f9149ddf-b35d-3ff0-b605-8e5bc7368826",
                        "glosses": [
                            "tsardom, kingdom, reign, ruling, governing (of an emperor)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9eb3e15-a345-49bf-9be6-1bf1f3ba35ad",
                                "sense_id": "54f8ad04-27ff-3bad-b13b-6e9ac80391ea",
                                "text": "Когда вспомню, что это случилось на моём веку и что ныне дожил я до кроткого царствования императора Александра, не могу не дивиться быстрым успехам просвещения и распространению правил человеколюбия.",
                                "translation": "When I call to mind that this has happened in my life-time, and that I have lived to see the mild reign of the Emperor Alexander, I cannot but marvel at the rapid strides civilization has made, and at the diffusion of humane measures.",
                                "english": "When I call to mind that this has happened in my life-time, and that I have lived to see the mild reign of the Emperor Alexander, I cannot but marvel at the rapid strides civilization has made, and at the diffusion of humane measures."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
